  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN268.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">kuṟai vēṇṭip piṉṉiṉṟa talaimakaṉukkuk kuṟai nērnta tōḻi talaimakaṭkuk kuṟai nayappak kūṟiyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante, who had granted the request of HIM who stood behind [her] making a request, said to HER so that she would agree to the request.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN268.1">
        <l>aṟi<supplied>yā</supplied>y vāḻi tōḻi poṟivarip</l>
        <l>pūnutal yāṉaiyoṭu puliporak kuḻainta</l>
        <l>kurutic ceṅkaḷam pōlavaṟa vēṅkai</l>
        <l>yurukeḻu nāṟṟaṅ kuḻaviyoṭu vilaṅku</l>
        <l>māmalai nāṭaṉoṭu maṟuviṉ ṟākiya</l>
        <l>kāmaṅ kalanta kāta luṇṭeṉi</l>
        <l>ṉaṉṟuma ṉatunī nāṭāy kūṟuti</l>
        <l>nāṇu naṭpu millōrt tēriṉ</l>
        <l>yāṉala tillaiyiv vulakat tāṉē</l>
        <l>yiṉṉuyi raṉṉa niṉṉoṭuñ cūḻātu</l>
        <l>muḷaiyaṇi mūṅkiliṟ kiḷaiyoṭu polinta</l>
        <l>perumpeya rentai yaruṅkaṭi nīvic</l>
        <l>ceytupiṉ ṉiraṅkā viṉaiyoṭu</l>
        <l><supplied>me</supplied>yyala perumpaḻi yeyti <supplied>ṉē</supplied>ṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1a-c">You don’t know, oh friend:</l>
        <l corresp="6">“Even if there is love, mixed with passion,</l>
        <l corresp="5">that is faultless, for the man from the land of vast mountains,</l>
        <l corresp="3">where the kino tree, withered like a blood-red [battle] field,</l>
        <l>that is spoiled when the tiger, with spots [and] stripes,</l>
        <l corresp="1d-2">fights with the elephant with a flower forehead,</l>
        <l corresp="4">lies athwart along with a calf that reeks of fear,</l>
        <l corresp="7">it is good indeed. That you do not take into consideration,” you may say.</l>
        <l corresp="8">If you seek those without shame and friendship,</l>
        <l corresp="9">there is none but me in this world.</l>
        <l corresp="10">Without consulting even with you who are like [my] sweet life,</l>
        <l corresp="12">brushing past  the severe protection of father with a great name,</l>
        <l corresp="11">who flourishes with [his] relatives like bamboo adorned with sprouts,</l>
        <l corresp="13">acting [and] not feeling aggrieved afterwards, with [this] deed</l>
        <l corresp="14">I have received great blame that is not real.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

